    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brophy Estates are delighted to present 16 St. Olave's, Kinsealy to the market.\r\n\r\nNo. 16 is a bright, spacious, and beautifully presented first-floor apartment, ideally located within the highly sought-after St. Olave's development at the junction of Malahide Road and Kinsealy Lane. Built in 2007, this superb two-bedroom home offers a fantastic opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors seeking a secure and conveniently located property.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a spacious living room opening onto a sunny west-facing balcony, a fully fitted kitchen with dining area, two generous double bedrooms (including a principal bedroom with en-suite), and a modern family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe property further benefits from gas-fired radiator central heating, PVC double-glazed windows, and a designated parking space.\r\n\r\nThe location is exceptional, just 3km from the picturesque village of Malahide and approximately 10km from Dublin City Centre. Excellent transport links are available with Dublin Bus routes 42 and 43 servicing the development, while the DART stations at Malahide and Portmarnock are just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy an excellent range of local amenities, including St. Nicholas of Myra National School, an on-site crèche, gym, and neighbourhood centre with a selection of retail outlets. Clare Hall Shopping Centre, together with Lidl and Dunnes Stores in Portmarnock, are also within easy reach.\r\n\r\nViewing of this excellent property is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation :\r\n\r\nFoyer : 1.67m x 2.34m\r\n\r\nHallway : 2.87m x 1.30m\r\n\r\nLiving Room : 4.37m x 4.01m\r\n\r\nDining Area : 5.74m x 2.51m\r\n\r\nKitchen : 2.50m x 3.60m\r\n\r\nMain Bedroom : 4.25m x 4.45m\r\n\r\nEnsuite : 0.85m x 2.91m\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 : 4.03m x 3.03m\r\n\r\nMain bathroom : 2.77m x 1.64m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Bright and spacious two-bedroom first-floor apartment\r\n\r\nWest-facing balcony\r\n\r\nPrincipal bedroom with en-suite\r\n\r\nGas-fired radiator central heating\r\n\r\nPVC double-glazed windows\r\n\r\nDesignated parking space\r\n\r\nExcellent transport links, including Dublin Bus routes 42 & 43\r\n\r\nClose to Malahide, Portmarnock, schools, shops, and a wide range of local amenities\r\n\r\nManagement fee €1600 per annum"
